    "title" : "17 Tawa Place, Orewa - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730964386609\" id=\"item-672c67cb9711642798e204e9\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-acd862a445697166bcff\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Five Spacious Bedrooms</strong>: Light-filled rooms with ample storage and quality finishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Three Living Areas</strong>: Versatile spaces for family gatherings, relaxation, or entertainment.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Modern Kitchen</strong>: Well-appointed with high-quality appliances and extensive storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage</strong>: Secure parking with additional storage space.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living</strong>: A beautifully landscaped garden and patio area for outdoor dining and leisure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Positioned in the sought-after Orewa area, 17 Tawa Place is close to local amenities, schools, and parks, providing a perfect blend of convenience and tranquility. This home embodies the best of New Zealand living, offering the comfort and flexibility to suit a variety of lifestyles.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672c686c9716cb069f32955a&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672c686c9716cb069f32955a&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_536877\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672c68d06d022122e9263af2\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730963679024-6CLM8STO5K5UL2CPJXQ8/17+Tawa+Pl%2C+Orewa++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%2814%29.jpg\" alt=\"17 Tawa Pl, Orewa  Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (14).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730963679024-6CLM8STO5K5UL2CPJXQ8/17+Tawa+Pl%2C+Orewa++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photogr